#: sdlc/processes/jsonld-drift-check.bpmn:36
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Run the five --check generators in one job — the JSON-LD context, block siblings, library nodes, site graph, then the label-resolution and emitter tests. Any committed .jsonld that differs from what its generator now produces fails the PR, because a stale generated file is still consulted."
msgstr ""

